<title>USA: Cytogen Corp warrants remain unaltered.</title>
<headline>Cytogen Corp warrants remain unaltered.</headline>
<dateline>PRINCETON, N.J. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cytogen Corp's board of directors considered a proposal to modify the terms of its warrants, but decided they were fair and in the best interests of shareholders, a company spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Cytogen warrants have an exercise price of $8.00 per share and will expire on January 31 1997.</p>
<p>Cytogen is a biopharmaceutical firm.</p>
</text>
